{"pages":[{"h":792,"ocr":false,"segs":[["W H Y S H O U L D I G O? 1",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,595.23090000000002,9,false],["WHY SHOULD I GO?",151.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,492.77999999999997,116.00059999999996,80,false],["HOW WILL IT HELP ME?",151.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,564.22000000000003,176.00059999999996,80,false],["The answer to whether you should attend an",146.40000000000001,225.43489999999986,314.61900000000009,237.8368999999999,9,false],["upcoming conference, or any conference, is a matter",146.40000000000001,238.43089999999984,344.09400000000005,250.83289999999988,9,false],["of discerning God’s will and being willing to do",146.40000000000001,251.42689999999982,322.43100000000015,263.82889999999986,9,false],["whatever he is asking you to do—stay or go. But as you",146.40000000000001,264.4228999999998,349.25100000000009,276.82489999999984,9,false],["pray and seek his will these are some things to reflect",146.40000000000001,277.41889999999989,346.74000000000012,289.82089999999988,9,false],["on as it relates to the spiritual and relational benefits",146.40000000000001,290.41489999999988,345.75000000000011,302.81689999999986,9,false],["of attending a conference or retreat.",146.40000000000001,303.41089999999986,282.41700000000003,315.81289999999984,9,false],["You’ll spend time in an environment that’s like a",146.40000000000001,329.22289999999981,340.35899999999992,342.20989999999983,9,false],["spiritual greenhouse and receive the equivalent of",146.40000000000001,342.21889999999979,348.56699999999995,355.20589999999982,9,false],["six months of quality input during four to five days.",146.40000000000001,355.21489999999977,351.68100000000004,368.2018999999998,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,381.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,393.83689999999996,9,false],["“And we proclaim Him, admonishing every man",164.40000000000001,381.43489999999997,345.36300000000006,393.83689999999996,9,false],["and teaching every man with all wisdom, that",164.40000000000001,394.43089999999995,335.80500000000006,406.83289999999994,9,false],["we may present every man complete in Christ.”",164.40000000000001,407.42689999999993,342.73500000000013,419.82889999999992,9,false],["(Colossians 1:28)",164.40000000000001,420.42289999999991,229.803,432.8248999999999,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,446.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,458.83689999999996,9,false],["“ . . . I press on in order that I may lay hold of",164.40000000000001,446.43489999999997,329.64900000000011,458.83689999999996,9,false],["that for which also I was laid hold of by Christ",164.40000000000001,459.43089999999995,337.31700000000012,471.83289999999994,9,false],["Jesus. Brethren, I do not regard myself as having",164.40000000000001,472.42689999999993,347.38800000000015,484.82889999999992,9,false],["laid hold of it yet; but one thing I do: forgetting",164.40000000000001,485.42289999999991,338.76600000000008,497.8248999999999,9,false],["what lies behind and reaching forward to what",164.40000000000001,498.41889999999989,340.29600000000005,510.82089999999988,9,false],["lies ahead, I press on toward the goal for the",164.40000000000001,511.41489999999988,329.46900000000005,523.81689999999981,9,false],["prize of the upward call of God in Christ Jesus.”",164.40000000000001,524.41089999999986,343.66200000000009,536.8128999999999,9,false],["(Philippians 3:12)",164.40000000000001,537.40689999999984,232.30500000000001,549.80889999999988,9,false],["You’ll be with hundreds of other Christians and get",146.40000000000001,563.21889999999985,351.303,576.20589999999982,9,false],["a larger picture of what God’s doing in the lives of",146.40000000000001,576.21489999999983,344.65200000000004,589.2018999999998,9,false],["other students and other campuses.",146.40000000000001,589.21089999999981,290.36400000000003,602.19789999999989,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,615.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,627.83690000000001,9,false],["“Without a vision the people perish.” (Proverbs",164.40000000000001,615.43489999999997,343.06800000000004,627.83690000000001,9,false],["29:18)",164.40000000000001,628.43090000000007,188.124,640.8329,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,654.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,666.83690000000001,9,false],["“That your hearts may be encouraged, having",164.40000000000001,654.43489999999997,335.13900000000007,666.83690000000001,9,false],["been knit together in love, and attaining to all",164.40000000000001,667.43089999999995,335.22000000000014,679.8329,9,false],["the wealth that comes from the full assurance of",164.40000000000001,680.42689999999993,346.34400000000005,692.82889999999998,9,false],["understanding, resulting in a true knowledge of",164.40000000000001,693.42290000000003,343.53600000000006,705.82489999999996,9,false],["God’s mystery, that is, Christ Himself, in whom",164.40000000000001,706.41890000000001,342.39300000000009,718.82089999999994,9,false],["are hidden all the treasures of wisdom and",388.20299999999997,225.4228999999998,548.43900000000008,237.82489999999984,9,false],["knowledge.” (Colossians 2:2,3)",388.20299999999997,238.41889999999978,504.22199999999998,250.82089999999982,9,false],["You’ll receive in-depth teaching from experienced",370.20299999999997,264.23089999999991,571.90200000000004,277.21789999999987,9,false],["and insightful Bible teachers.",370.20299999999997,277.22689999999989,488.76900000000001,290.21389999999985,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,303.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,315.83689999999996,9,false],["“Like newborn babes, long for the pure milk of",388.20000000000005,303.43489999999997,562.51200000000006,315.83689999999996,9,false],["the Word, that by it you may grow in respect to",388.20000000000005,316.43089999999995,563.6550000000002,328.83289999999994,9,false],["salvation.” (1 Peter 2:2)",388.20000000000005,329.42689999999993,475.93200000000007,341.82889999999992,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,355.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,367.83689999999996,9,false],["“Be diligent to present yourself approved to",388.20000000000005,355.43489999999997,552.05400000000009,367.83689999999996,9,false],["God as a workman who does not need to be",388.20000000000005,368.43089999999995,549.76800000000014,380.83289999999994,9,false],["ashamed, handling accurately the Word of truth.”",388.20000000000005,381.42689999999993,574.31100000000015,393.82889999999992,9,false],["(2Timothy 2:15)",388.20000000000005,394.42289999999991,449.92200000000003,406.8248999999999,9,false],["You’ll get to know other believers in a deeper way.",370.20000000000005,420.23489999999987,569.96400000000006,433.22189999999989,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,446.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,458.83689999999996,9,false],["“We ought always to give thanks to God for you",388.20000000000005,446.43489999999997,565.221,458.83689999999996,9,false],["brethren, as is only fitting, because your faith",388.20000000000005,459.43089999999995,558.23700000000008,471.83289999999994,9,false],["is greatly enlarged, and the love of each one of",388.20000000000005,472.42689999999993,560.38800000000015,484.82889999999992,9,false],["you toward one another grows ever greater.” (2",388.20000000000005,485.42289999999991,564.18600000000015,497.8248999999999,9,false],["Thessalonians 1:3)",388.20000000000005,498.41889999999989,459.48900000000003,510.82089999999988,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,524.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,536.83690000000001,9,false],["“Let us hold fast the confession of our hope",388.20000000000005,524.43489999999997,550.97400000000005,536.83690000000001,9,false],["without wavering, for He who promised is",388.20000000000005,537.43090000000007,546.93300000000011,549.8329,9,false],["faithful; and let us consider how to stimulate one",388.20000000000005,550.42690000000005,572.62800000000016,562.82889999999998,9,false],["another to love and good deeds, not forsaking",388.20000000000005,563.42290000000003,558.35400000000016,575.82490000000007,9,false],["our own assembling together, as is the habit of",388.20000000000005,576.41890000000012,562.40400000000011,588.82090000000005,9,false],["some, but encouraging one another, and all the",388.20000000000005,589.41489999999999,563.5920000000001,601.81690000000003,9,false],["more, as you see the day drawing near.” (Hebrews",388.20000000000005,602.41090000000008,574.42800000000011,614.81290000000013,9,false],["10:23-25)",388.20000000000005,615.40690000000006,424.78500000000003,627.80890000000011,9,false],["There are training levels specifically designed to",370.20000000000005,641.21890000000008,565.40100000000007,654.20590000000004,9,false],["meet each of your ministry needs, along with a",370.20000000000005,654.21490000000006,557.03999999999996,667.20190000000002,9,false],["variety of optional seminars.",370.20000000000005,667.21090000000004,486.3900000000001,680.19790000000012,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,693.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,705.83690000000001,9,false],["“Blessed are those who hunger and thirst for",388.20000000000005,693.43489999999997,555.90600000000018,705.83690000000001,9,false],["righteousness, for they shall be satisfied.”",388.20000000000005,706.43089999999995,544.19700000000012,718.8329,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",204.23800660000001,766.03521969999997,407.76200660000006,778.43721970000001,9,false]],"w":612},{"h":792,"segs":[["•",146.40000000000001,59.434899999999857,150.54000000000002,71.836899999999901,9,false],["(Matthew 5:6)",164.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,218.72400000000002,45.836899999999901,9,false],["“Now on the last day, the great day of the feast,",164.40000000000001,59.434899999999857,339.09000000000003,71.836899999999901,9,false],["Jesus stood and cried out, saying, `If any man is",164.40000000000001,72.430899999999838,342.78000000000009,84.832899999999881,9,false],["thirsty, let him come to Me and drink. He who",164.40000000000001,85.426899999999819,337.07400000000007,97.828899999999862,9,false],["believes in Me, as the scripture said, from his",164.40000000000001,98.4228999999998,334.59900000000005,110.82489999999984,9,false],["innermost being shall flow rivers of living water.’”",164.40000000000001,111.41889999999978,351.94200000000012,123.82089999999982,9,false],["(John 7:37-38)",164.40000000000001,124.41489999999976,220.16399999999999,136.81689999999981,9,false],["You’ll experience one of the most wonderful times",146.40000000000001,150.22689999999989,348.18899999999996,163.21389999999985,9,false],["of singing and enjoying God!",146.40000000000001,163.22289999999987,260.44799999999998,176.20989999999983,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,46.434899999999857,374.34000000000003,58.836899999999901,9,false],["“Now faith is the assurance of things hoped for,",388.20000000000005,46.434899999999857,566.202,58.836899999999901,9,false],["the conviction of things not seen. And without",388.20000000000005,59.430899999999838,562.98000000000013,71.832899999999881,9,false],["faith it is impossible to please Him, for he who",388.20000000000005,72.426899999999819,562.87200000000007,84.828899999999862,9,false],["comes to God must believe that He is, and that He",388.20000000000005,85.4228999999998,575.4000000000002,97.824899999999843,9,false],["is a rewarder of those who seek Him.” (Hebrews",388.20000000000005,98.41889999999978,569.04600000000005,110.82089999999982,9,false],["11:1,6)",388.20000000000005,111.41489999999976,412.01400000000007,123.81689999999981,9,false],["Step out then and make plans. God will take care of",370.20000000000005,137.41589999999974,562.31400000000008,149.81789999999978,9,false],["your needs. If He doesn’t want you to go, He’ll close",370.20000000000005,150.41189999999972,562.61099999999999,162.81389999999976,9,false],["the door. When we grab the doorknob and pull on it",370.20000000000005,163.4078999999997,562.8180000000001,175.80989999999974,9,false],["we find out if the door is open or closed. “And my God",370.20000000000005,176.40389999999968,570.51300000000003,188.80589999999972,9,false],["shall supply all your needs according to His riches in",370.20000000000005,189.39989999999966,568.63200000000006,201.8018999999997,9,false],["glory in Christ Jesus.” (Phil. 4:19)",370.20000000000005,202.39589999999964,496.56000000000006,214.79789999999969,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,189.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,201.8368999999999,9,false],["“And let the peace of Christ rule in your hearts,",164.40000000000001,189.43489999999986,341.08800000000008,201.8368999999999,9,false],["to which indeed you were called in one body;",164.40000000000001,202.43089999999984,332.47500000000014,214.83289999999988,9,false],["and be thankful. Let the word of Christ richly",164.40000000000001,215.42689999999982,334.9140000000001,227.82889999999986,9,false],["dwell within you, with all wisdom teaching",164.40000000000001,228.4228999999998,326.56200000000013,240.82489999999984,9,false],["and admonishing one another with psalms",164.40000000000001,241.41889999999978,325.59900000000005,253.82089999999982,9,false],["and hymns and spiritual songs, singing with",164.40000000000001,254.41489999999976,330.30600000000004,266.81689999999981,9,false],["thankfulness in your hearts to God.” (Colossians",164.40000000000001,267.41089999999974,347.17200000000003,279.81289999999979,9,false],["3:15-16)",164.40000000000001,280.40689999999984,195.00900000000001,292.80889999999982,9,false],["God will touch your life in a special way.",146.40000000000001,306.21889999999979,307.52700000000004,319.20589999999982,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,332.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,344.83689999999996,9,false],["“For I know the plans that I have for you, declares",164.40000000000001,332.43489999999997,351.12300000000005,344.83689999999996,9,false],["the Lord, plans for welfare and not for calamity",164.40000000000001,345.43089999999995,342.22200000000009,357.83289999999994,9,false],["to give you a future and a hope. Then you will",164.40000000000001,358.42689999999993,334.09500000000003,370.82889999999992,9,false],["call upon Me and come and pray to Me, and I",164.40000000000001,371.42289999999991,332.49300000000011,383.8248999999999,9,false],["will listen to you. And you will seek Me and find",164.40000000000001,384.41889999999989,343.77900000000011,396.82089999999988,9,false],["Me, when you search for Me with all your heart.”",164.40000000000001,397.41489999999988,347.75700000000012,409.81689999999986,9,false],["(Jeremiah 29:11-13)",164.40000000000001,410.41089999999986,240.56700000000004,422.81289999999984,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,436.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,448.83689999999996,9,false],["“If then you have been raised up with Christ, keep",164.40000000000001,436.43489999999997,351.96000000000004,448.83689999999996,9,false],["seeking the things above, where Christ is, seated",164.40000000000001,449.43089999999995,346.92900000000009,461.83289999999994,9,false],["at the right hand of God. Set your mind of the",164.40000000000001,462.42689999999993,333.99600000000009,474.82889999999992,9,false],["things above, not on the things that are on earth.”",164.40000000000001,475.42289999999991,349.17900000000009,487.8248999999999,9,false],["(Colossians 3:1-2)",164.40000000000001,488.41889999999989,232.98899999999998,500.82089999999988,9,false],["W H Y S H O U L D I G O? 2",43.841200000000001,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,596.02279999999996,9,false],["Other things to consider:",146.40000000000001,514.23089999999979,247.173,527.21789999999987,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,540.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,552.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,566.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,578.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,592.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,604.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,618.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,630.83690000000001,9,false],["Money is no problem with God. He will supply all",164.40000000000001,540.43489999999997,350.09700000000009,552.83690000000001,9,false],["we truly need.",164.40000000000001,553.43090000000007,217.69800000000001,565.8329,9,false],["If finances weren’t involved would you go? (Matt.",164.40000000000001,566.43489999999997,349.79100000000011,578.83690000000001,9,false],["6:31-35)",164.40000000000001,579.43090000000007,195.76500000000001,591.8329,9,false],["Getting there is no problem! Contact Student",164.40000000000001,592.43489999999997,335.25600000000009,604.83690000000001,9,false],["LINC—we’ll locate transportation.",164.40000000000001,605.43090000000007,295.99800000000005,617.8329,9,false],["This is a chance to see God meet your need.",164.40000000000001,618.43489999999997,327.85800000000006,630.83690000000001,9,false],["What is stepping out in faith?",146.40000000000001,644.24689999999998,265.101,657.23389999999995,9,false],["Faith is not saying to God, “Lord, if You do ‘X’ and ‘Y’,",146.40000000000001,670.43690000000004,344.70600000000002,682.83889999999997,9,false],["I’ll go to the conference.” Rather, faith is saying, “Lord,",146.40000000000001,683.43290000000002,351.1230000000001,695.83489999999995,9,false],["I’m going because I believe You want me there and I’ll",146.40000000000001,696.4289,348.09900000000005,708.83089999999993,9,false],["trust You to take care of any problem.”",146.40000000000001,709.42489999999998,290.22900000000004,721.82690000000002,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",204.23800660000001,766.03521969999997,407.76200660000006,778.43721970000001,9,false]],"ocr":false,"w":612}]}